.local-libs/

# Godot Web exports. docs/ is still committed today so the branch keeps serving the
# playtest build from GitHub Pages. Once the Actions workflow in
# .github/workflows/deploy-web.yml has been run and confirmed by the owner, stop
# committing builds by uncommenting the two lines below and running
#   git rm --cached docs/index.pck docs/index.wasm
# (a .gitignore rule alone never untracks a file already in the index). Keep docs/index.html
# and the small companions if the branch-served build is retired together with them.
# docs/index.pck
# docs/index.wasm
